# agent/skill definitions below are per-machine and deliberately not.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
.agents/
.claude/agents/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated artifacts and internal outputs — NEVER commit.
# outputs/ holds scraped lead data and contact PII; this repo is public.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
outputs/
cold-outreach/workflows/
cold-outreach/docs/*.pdf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cold-outreach operator runbooks — untracked like INFRASTRUCTURE.md.
